{
    "title": "Smart & Final",
    "description": "Experience the smaller, faster grocery warehouse store for household and business customers with the new and improved Smart & Final App. Shop our new features to find great deals for your every need and budget in mind:\r\n\r\n\r\n- Order online for delivery & store pickup \r\n- Access digital only deals and coupons\r\n- Browse personalized offers delivered straight to your inbox\r\n- View the weekly ad for your nearest location\r\n- Save your order history for faster shopping\r\n- Shop from our recipes and add-to-cart \r\n\r\nSmart & Final has been the grocery store of choice for households and businesses since 1871. With the Smart & Final App, shop our vast selection of fresh produce, quality meats and assortment of local and national brands at the lowest possible prices, all from the comfort of your phone. Download the app & start saving!\r\n\r\nONLINE ORDER\r\nWe make it easy to order your favorite groceries, household essentials and more for same-day delivery.\r\n\r\nWEEKLY ADS\r\nBrowse, create lists and shop directly from our Weekly Ads. Sign up to receive your local ad directly in your inbox to never miss a deal.\r\n \r\nONLINE EXCLUSIVES & DIGITAL COUPONS\r\nReceive online-only promotions and digital coupons. Visit your coupon gallery to clip, scan and save on your favorite brands and products. \r\n \r\nACCESS YOUR SHOPPING HISTORY \r\nSave and view your current and past orders for easy and quick shopping.\r\n\r\nVISIT US IN STORE\r\nOrdering for pickup? Locate your nearest Smart & Final with our store locator.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience the smaller, faster grocery warehouse store for household and business customers with the new and improved Smart &amp; Final App. Shop our new features to find great deals for your every need and budget in mind:<br><br><br>- Order online for delivery &amp; store pickup <br>- Access digital only deals and coupons<br>- Browse personalized offers delivered straight to your inbox<br>- View the weekly ad for your nearest location<br>- Save your order history for faster shopping<br>- Shop from our recipes and add-to-cart <br><br>Smart &amp; Final has been the grocery store of choice for households and businesses since 1871. With the Smart &amp; Final App, shop our vast selection of fresh produce, quality meats and assortment of local and national brands at the lowest possible prices, all from the comfort of your phone. Download the app &amp; start saving!<br><br>ONLINE ORDER<br>We make it easy to order your favorite groceries, household essentials and more for same-day delivery.<br><br>WEEKLY ADS<br>Browse, create lists and shop directly from our Weekly Ads. Sign up to receive your local ad directly in your inbox to never miss a deal.<br> <br>ONLINE EXCLUSIVES &amp; DIGITAL COUPONS<br>Receive online-only promotions and digital coupons. Visit your coupon gallery to clip, scan and save on your favorite brands and products. <br> <br>ACCESS YOUR SHOPPING HISTORY <br>Save and view your current and past orders for easy and quick shopping.<br><br>VISIT US IN STORE<br>Ordering for pickup? Locate your nearest Smart &amp; Final with our store locator.",
